# Salary Manager — docs pipeline (Frontend)

Canonical product docs live in this frontend repo. Backend links here for whole-project requirements.

## Paths

| Artifact | Location |
|---|---|
| Whole-project requirements | `docs/requirements/project.md` |
| FE feature requirements | `docs/requirements/features/<feature-slug>.md` |
| Architecture | `docs/architecture/<feature-slug>.md` |
| Implementation plan | `docs/plans/<feature-slug>.md` |

## Rules

- Keep **whole-project** requirements only in `docs/requirements/project.md`. Update it when product scope changes.
- Keep **feature-specific** requirements in this repo under `docs/requirements/features/` when the work is FE-owned or cross-cutting (include BE API notes; BE keeps its own BE-specific feature file).
- Architecture docs must name FE vs BE ownership, APIs, and data shapes.
- Plans must list tasks with exact file paths and verification steps.
- Do not invent requirements: capture what the user approved in brainstorming.
